        <procedure title="Adds a Firm Impact Score" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add a Firm Impact Score</p>
            <p>Verifies a firm impact score can be created with required details.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Firm Evaluation Grades. 2. Click "Add" and fill in the name, regulation group, risk points, and color. 3. Save the impact score.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The firm impact score is successfully added.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
